ifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/mfaConfirm(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/auth\/mfa\/confirm"},{"type":"text","text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1) — activate the factor"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/mfaEnroll()"},{"type":"text","text":" offered. Returns whether MFA is now enabled."}],"role":"symbol","title":"mfaConfirm(_:)"}}}